Usage:
  nucleus collectstatic [flags]

Copy every file of the static source directories into --output (or the configured static_root), first source wins on duplicate paths.

Flags:
  -clear
    	Delete output directory before collecting
  -config string
    	Path to nucleus config file
  -dry-run
    	Print copy plan without writing files
  -no-default-sources
    	Disable default static source discovery
  -output string
    	Destination directory (defaults to config static_root)
  -source string
    	Comma-separated source directories

Examples:
  nucleus collectstatic --config nucleus.yml --output public/assets
  nucleus collectstatic --config nucleus.yml --dry-run
